<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"/>
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/>
<title>Reviewer needs more information: {!IndividualApplication.ApplicationName}</title>

<style>
html,body{margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;width:100% !important;}
body{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;background:#F4F4F5;}
table{border-collapse:collapse !important;}
img{border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;}
a{color:#BF2026;}
@media only screen and (max-width:620px){
.container{width:100% !important;max-width:100% !important;}
.pad{padding-left:22px !important;padding-right:22px !important;}
.logo-hdr{width:100px !important;}
.logo-ftr{width:114px !important;}
.hdr-text{font-size:19px !important;}
}
</style>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F4F4F5;">
<center style="width:100%;background-color:#F4F4F5;">

<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;">
{!IndividualApplication.Organization_Name__c} · The reviewer has returned this application to you with a question.
</div>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F4F4F5">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">

<table class="container" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #E6E6E6;border-radius:8px;">

<tr>
<td bgcolor="#BF2026" style="padding:24px 32px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;">

<!-- Header: text left, logo right (same row) -->
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="middle">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F9C9A8;">
Returned for input
</p>

<h1 class="hdr-text" style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;">
Returned to you for input
</h1>

<p style="margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#F9C9A8;">
Application {!IndividualApplication.ApplicationName} · {!IndividualApplication.Organization_Name__c}
</p>
</td>
<td align="right" valign="middle" width="136" style="padding-left:16px;">
<img src="https://wadhwanifoundation--wgsandbox.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015e10000020UmX&oid=00DF6000000APXN&lastMod=1782557340000" width="136" alt="Wadhwani Grants" class="logo-hdr" style="display:block;width:136px;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;"/>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td bgcolor="#F2672A" height="4" style="height:4px;font-size:4px;line-height:4px;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="pad" style="padding:28px 32px 10px;">

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
Hi {!IndividualApplication.WG_Validator_Name__c},
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
The reviewer has returned this application to you. They need more information before they can finish the evaluation.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
What the reviewer asked for:
</p>

<!-- Panel -->
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#F7F2F2;border-left:3px solid #F2672A;border-radius:3px;margin:4px 0 18px;">
<tr>
<td style="padding:16px 20px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#414042;">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6D6E71;">
What the reviewer asked for
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
{{{reviewer_request}}}
</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6D6E71;">
Application round: {!IndividualApplication.Submission_Round__c}
</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
Two steps to close this:
</p>

<ol style="margin:0 0 15px;padding-left:22px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
<li style="margin:0 0 8px;">Check whether the answer is already in the application. If it is, point the reviewer to the page and question where it sits.</li>
<li style="margin:0;">If it is genuinely missing, return the application to the applicant and ask for that detail.</li>
</ol>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
The applicant sees no change until you return it to them. Please act by <strong>{!IndividualApplication.Due_Date__c}</strong>, so the evaluation is not held up.
</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px;">
<tr>
<td align="center" bgcolor="#BF2026" style="border-radius:4px;">
<a href="https://wadhwanifoundation--wgsandbox.sandbox.my.site.com/reviewersite" target="_blank"
style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 30px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;">
Open the application
</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:18px 0 8px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#414042;">
Wadhwani Grants Platform
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="padding:0 32px;">
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E6E6E6;margin:6px 0 0;"/>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="pad" style="padding:22px 32px 26px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">

<img src="https://wadhwanifoundation--wgsandbox.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015e10000020VVh&oid=00DF6000000APXN&lastMod=1782560396000"
width="132" alt="Wadhwani Grants" class="logo-ftr" style="display:block;width:132px;height:auto;margin:0 0 12px;"/>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
Wadhwani Grants — the grant-making arm of the Wadhwani Foundation.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
Questions? Reply at
<a href="mailto:grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org" style="color:#6D6E71;text-decoration:underline;">
grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org
</a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
© {!YEAR(TODAY())} Wadhwani Charitable Foundation. All rights reserved.
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
<a href="{{{preferences_url}}}" style="color:#6D6E71;text-decoration:underline;">
Notification preferences
</a>
</p>

</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

</center>
</body>
</html>